  data: {
    LLM: "As the King, use your 'Taxes' (the high cards from the Peasant) to control the game immediately. Lead with a pair of High cards to prevent anyone else from taking control early.\n\nThe 'Peasant Revolution': If you are the Peasant, and you have a 2 (Burner), don't give it up in the tax if you can help it. Use it mid-round to break the King's control and jump to the 'Nobility' rank.\n\nStalling: If you are the King, 'pass' your turn even if you can play, if you think someone else can clear the pile with a card you want to save for later. This 'baits' the Nobility into using their high cards.",
    Player: "As the King, use your 'Taxes' (the high cards from the Peasant) to control the game immediately. Lead with a pair of High cards to prevent anyone else from taking control early.\n\nThe 'Peasant Revolution': If you are the Peasant, and you have a 2 (Burner), don't give it up in the tax if you can help it. Use it mid-round to break the King's control and jump to the 'Nobility' rank.\n\nStalling: If you are the King, 'pass' your turn even if you can play, if you think someone else can clear the pile with a card you want to save for later. This 'baits' the Nobility into using their high cards.",
